{
  "id": "poem-a87629a434ab63a7818c30b8",
  "title": "望远行",
  "author": "萧德祥《小孙屠》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "离了故乡，跋涉崎岖劳攘。",
    "水宿风餐，旅况怎消遣？(末上)那日方离家乡，回首家乡怎想？且缓步徐徐行上。",
    "(婆)。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-8647",
